OCPARTICLE 2
NAME Sparks
# Metal sparks for a hard impact. Self-lit and additive, with their own gravity; SPAWNAT on, like TyreSmoke.
EMITTER Sparks
SIM auto
SHAPE sphere 6
BLEND additive
EMISSION 0 12 512
LIFETIME 0.4 0.9
DIRECTION 0 0 1 60
SPEED 180 420
GRAVITY 0 0 -700
DAMPING 0.05
SIZE 2 0.5
COLOR start 1 0.8 0.35 1
COLOR end 1 0.25 0.05 0
SPRITE velocity stretch 0.5
SORT none
LIGHTING unlit
FOG on
SPAWNAT on
BOUNDS 500
